<title>USA: Clapton wins best male pop vocal Grammy.</title>
<headline>Clapton wins best male pop vocal Grammy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rock guitarist Eric Clapton on Wednesday won a Grammy -- the U.S. music industry's top accolade -- for the best male pop vocal performance for his song &quot;Change the World.&quot;</p>
</text>
